title: "Appwrite Beep for iOS and Android"
date: 2026-12-03
cover: /images/blog/introducing-appwrite-beep/cover.avif
tags: monitors, alerts, mobile, cloud
---

Appwrite Beep is the new Appwrite Cloud app for your phone. It sends a push the moment one of your monitors fires, with buttons to acknowledge or snooze the alert right from the notification.

Beep lists what is firing across your organizations, shows where each alert's escalation stands, and lets you adjust a monitor's threshold from the alert. Critical monitors ring on silent at alarm volume. Beep also charts your projects' usage, shows ongoing Cloud incidents, and brings new changelog entries to your phone. On tablets and foldables, it switches to a dashboard layout.

Beep is available now on the App Store and Google Play. Sign in with your Appwrite Cloud account to get started.

